      "value": "@{5e59bc346312bf2d549f33ab|full_name} The Unity 2022 client used by VRChat has been patched in VRChat 2025.3.3p1 ([2025.3.3p1 release notes are missing](https://feedback.vrchat.com/website/p/missing-vrchat-202533p1-release-notes)). Unity Editor 2022.3.22f1 is supposedly safe for the purpose of editing and publishing VRChat avatars and worlds.\n\n- https://x.com/VRChat/status/1974245985045131450\n\n- https://creators.vrchat.com/sdk/upgrade/current-unity-version/#october-2025-unity-security-vulnerability-warning",
