      "value": "@{5e59bc346312bf2d549f33ab|full_name} What features does the newest unity offer thats worth the massive hassle and major costs it would take to convert the entire game again? Not to mention it would also make avatar and world creation more difficult, as the new unity editor runs SLOWER. \n\nVRChat just switched Unity versions 2 years ago, and there is still alot of cool content that hasn't been updated yet to be compatible with the new version. \n\nSo what are these super amazing new features that makes it all worth the massive expensive hassle, downgrade in user productivity and workflow, and making hundrends of thousands of worlds and avatars require updates?",
